          "description": "While in Resonance Mode - Tune Rupture, when Tune Rupture DMG triggered by Resonance Skill Seraphic Duet hits the same target, the DMG Multiplier of Tune Rupture DMG trigger by Resonance Skill Seraphic Duet is increased by 20% for 1s, stacking up to 5 times.",
