          "name": "Sequence Node 4: Ethereal Waltz on Binary Tides",
          "description": "When casting Intro Skill Songs Across the Universe, Intro Skill Debut of Meteoric Radiance, Resonance Skill Sync Strike and Resonance Skill Seraphic Duet, Resonators in the team gain 20% All-Attribute DMG Bonus for 30s.",
