          "key": "SequenceNode2CleansedinCrimsonWar",
          "name": "Sequence Node 2: Cleansed in Crimson War",
          "description": "- Crown of Wills provides additional effects: Each stack increases Augusta's Crit. Rate by 20%.\n- For every 1% of Crit. Rate over 100%, Augusta gains 2% Crit. DMG increase, up to 100%.",
