          "key": "SequenceNode3ForgedinRotandRuin",
          "name": "Sequence Node 3: Forged in Rot and Ruin",
          "description": "The following skills have their DMG Multiplier increased by 25%: \n- Heavy Attack - Thunderoar: Backstep, Dodge Counter - Thunderoar: Backstep, Heavy Attack - Thunderoar: Spinslash, Heavy Attack - Thunderoar: Uppercut.\n- Resonance Skill - Undying Sunlight: Plunge.\n- Resonance Liberation - Sublime is the Sun: Sunborne, Resonance Liberation - Sublime is the Sun: Everbright Protector.",
          "sourceKind": "sequence",
          "sourceId": "Augusta",
          "scope": "self",
          "valueUnit": "decimal",
