          "name": "Sequence Node 4: Severing the Endless Cycle of Tragic Fate",
          "description": "The effect of Unseen Snare becomes:\n\nWhen targets marked by Unseen Snare take direct damage from Resonators, Chisa inflicts 1 stack of Havoc Bane on them. This effect is triggered up to once every 1s.",
