          "key": "SequenceNode1WaxorWaneAllGildtheBough",
          "name": "Sequence Node 1: Wax or Wane, All Gild the Bough",
          "description": "When Iuno is in Lunar Cycle, her ATK is increased by 40%.\nWhen Iuno is inside the Full Moon Domain, she additionally restores 1 point of Resonance Energy per second.\nResonance Skill - Arc Beyond the Edge and Heavy Attack - Absolute Fullness become immune to interruption.",
