          "key": "SequenceNode3IDrinkDeepofTheirForgetting",
          "name": "Sequence Node 3: I Drink Deep of Their Forgetting",
          "description": "When Iuno is in Lunar Cycle, DMG dealt by Moonbow - Basic Attack, Resonance Skill - Arc Beyond the Edge, and Moonbow - Dodge Counter is Amplified by 65%.\nWithin a certain period after performing Moonbow - Basic Attack or Moonbow - Dodge Counter, casting Resonance Skill - Arc Beyond the Edge does not reset the cycle of Moonbow - Basic Attack.",
          "sourceKind": "sequence",
          "sourceId": "Iuno",
          "scope": "self",
