          "key": "AureateJudgeGavelofEarthshaker",
          "name": "Aureate Judge - Gavel of Earthshaker",
          "description": "Casting Aureole of Execution: Glare increases the DMG Multiplier of the next Mid-air Attack - Gavel of Earthshaker and Ichor Deposit DMG by 110%.\n- 100 points of Ichor Flow is consumed each time Resonance Skill Aureole of Execution is cast.\n- Aureate Judge ends when Ichor Flow depletes.",
