          "name": "Sequence Node 3: Spine Tempered by Golden Rain",
          "description": "The DMG Multipliers of all forms of Resonance Skill Aureole of Execution are increased by 136% in the Aureate Judge state. Casting Aureole of Execution: Glare increases the DMG Multipliers of the next Mid-Attack - Gavel of Earthshaker and Ichor Deposit by 136%.\n\nInherent Skill Pulses Under the Snow is enhanced:\n\nPerpetuating Daytime now stacks up to 4 times.",
