          "description": "Casting Heavy Attack Thus Spoke the Blade: To Sacrifice stagnates nearby targets for 3s or until the targets are damaged or until Qiuyuan is switched off the field.\nWhen Qiuyuan is the active Resonator in the team, upon exiting Inksplash of Mind, he deals Aero DMG equal to 600% of his ATK to all targets within range, considered Echo Skill DMG.",
